Conflicts: keen-pbr
Replaces: keen-pbr
Provides: keen-pbr
Description: keen-pbr-sx policy routing with REST API and Web UI
 keen-pbr-sx routes selected traffic through a sing-box TUN on Keenetic
 and shows per-outbound traffic. Based on keen-pbr by Maxim Kurbatov.
 The package name remains keen-pbr-sx.
 This package includes the daemon, REST API, and bundled frontend assets.
 Install xtables-addons-dkms only when using the iptables backend.
